{"id":"e9155fcdafc74583","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-kleene-char.md","title":"有效解析的递归树正规形（待证明）","display":"thm-kleene-char — 有效解析的递归树正规形（待证明）","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-kleene-char","aliases":["20-thm-kleene-char"],"display":"thm-kleene-char — 有效解析的递归树正规形（待证明）","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.hyperarithmetic","source_kind":"legacy-supplement","verification_status":"pending-source","source_reference":"旧命题的规范化；原始文献与证明待补","depends_on":["[[20-df-anal]]","[[20-df-tree]]","[[20-df-recursive]]","[[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]","[[20-df-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-kleene-char"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-kleene-char</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kleene-char — 有效解析的递归树正规形（待证明）"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.hyperarithmetic"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"legacy-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"pending-source"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"旧命题的规范化；原始文献与证明待补"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0abc357ef7715d00\" href=\"?note=0abc357ef7715d00\" title=\"20-df-anal\">20-df-anal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9885f96cf9cb2fff\" href=\"?note=9885f96cf9cb2fff\" title=\"20-df-finite-sequence-code\">20-df-finite-sequence-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_x=\\{\\sigma:(x,\\sigma)\\in T\\}\">\\(T_x=\\{\\sigma:(x,\\sigma)\\in T\\}\\)</span>；定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat T=\\{\\langle x,\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\sigma)\\rangle:(x,\\sigma)\\in T\\}\">\\(\\widehat T=\\{\\langle x,\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\sigma)\\rangle:(x,\\sigma)\\in T\\}\\)</span>。被存在量化的树及其可计算性均在断言内约束。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0abc357ef7715d00\" href=\"?note=0abc357ef7715d00\" title=\"20-df-anal\">20-df-anal</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9885f96cf9cb2fff\" href=\"?note=9885f96cf9cb2fff\" title=\"20-df-finite-sequence-code\">20-df-finite-sequence-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"todo\"><div class=\"callout-title\">核验边界</div><p>本条状态为 pending-source；正文给出修订后的定义或命题草案，尚缺完整来源核对或独立证明。不可仅凭文件类型将其作为已认证定理使用。</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}char}\\vdash\nA\\in\\Sigma^1_1\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists T\\subseteq\\omega\\times\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\widehat T\\in\\mathcal R\\land(\\forall x\\ \\operatorname{Tree}_\\omega(T_x))\\land\n\\forall x\\ (x\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow[T_x]\\ne\\varnothing)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}char}\\vdash\nA\\in\\Sigma^1_1\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists T\\subseteq\\omega\\times\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\widehat T\\in\\mathcal R\\land(\\forall x\\ \\operatorname{Tree}_\\omega(T_x))\\land\n\\forall x\\ (x\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow[T_x]\\ne\\varnothing)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>修前“可计算的 T”只约束 Hypothesis 中的自由变量，但断言重新用存在量词绑定 T，遗漏可计算性会使右边对每个任意 A 都成立：取 T_x=ω^{&lt;ω} 或空树分别编码 x∈A 与 x∉A。现将统一可计算条件放入同一个存在量词作用域。这里必须使用 Baire 空间的自然数分支树及统一可计算的 x 参数，不能用有限分支二进制树代替。旧稿的 RecTree 未定义且省略统一参数；已规范化正确的标准陈述。Soare 2016 不含该正规形的证明，本条标为未核实书外命题，不供已核实核心自动引用。</p>\n<p>来源：旧命题的规范化；原始文献与证明待补。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-anal","status":"resolved","id":"0abc357ef7715d00","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-anal]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"9885f96cf9cb2fff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":fa